Component: Highly Experimental (PlayStation 1/2 PSF) -- REMOVED FROM THE TREE
Author: Neill Corlett (the PSF format and the original Highly Experimental);
        vendored here in kode54's form, formerly at
        musicplayer/src/plugins/heplugin/.
License: NONE STATED. There was no licence file, no SPDX identifier and no
        per-file licence header anywhere in the vendored tree or in the upstream
